<title>USA: USA: First USA Inc Q1 oper shr increases.</title>
<headline>USA: First USA Inc Q1 oper shr increases.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Dollars in thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>		 THREE MONTHS ENDED SEPTEMBER 30, 1996 AND 1995</p>
<p>						  September 30,</p>
<p>				   ---------------------------</p>
<p>						 1996	  1995</p>
<p>Earnings</p>
<p>    Net income			$  64,056    $  54,895</p>
<p>     Net income per share		0.95	   0.83</p>
<p>Earnings excluding one-time</p>
<p>charge</p>
<p>    Income			    71,505(a)	 54,895</p>
<p>    Income per share		  1.06(a)	   0.83</p>
<p>Weighted average common and</p>
<p>common equivalent shares</p>
<p>					 67,761,817   66,374,643</p>
<p>(a) Results exclude a one-time charge by its unit, First USA Paymentech Inc of $15.5 million (which reduced First USA Paymentech's net income by $9.7 million, or $0.30 per share). This one-time charge reduced First USA Inc's net income by $7.4 million, or $0.11 per share.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
